 "id": "324169743635280", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86620220_324169746968613_7117931673492806532_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9G17Hy9Zrm8Q7kNvwGShG0s&_nc_oc=Adoez-Ir7LhcS2fp-rAvsHBxiJAbvo35X88USD9MLy0bFqQ1C7b_GxeMy5-P9yZ0A9A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af63HekI1LTqb_oAp1r-wYjXRCJFCiRWqdr__4MRV4EDng&oe=6A0C5F27"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "284554587659447", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_284554590992780_5763669827891232699_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-i3VE4bNHZMQ7kNvwEaGvsl&_nc_oc=Adru9Jd-5q95_o30W4x0dRA5TL8v4YMHly5BxxW1Igep1fvyS9-JAecpFR_naqUTCmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6O4cdtdn3VWnfszcduAa7jjXYXp2Z8AyR5-fjW_CNVnw&oe=6A0C5604"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "677824147318518", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/54823267_677824150651851_3688777864047447478_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivPmD8htYScQ7kNvwEWjC3l&_nc_oc=AdqKlsMFZeq9DPpGOKl-ft-oh2K7ZZnO80DEYSqf7XBvaD6joQd4005qrUu_5cXF1hs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7zCrUFHEsb7P32hu_gf95D2d1HCk4VbWiV1L-cs8QZeA&oe=6A0C5CEE"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "329704216222612", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250460_329704219555945_6993099148500521476_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HzVJFCt9g4MQ7kNvwGRZzNE&_nc_oc=AdpLF-HU9J37ENPfmaV0CkOuXtxOuVS6pKqi5xObxc0FwlBizN1iFpt7TVTr6zF6-SM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5EgbBVX4spT8-eLfWZljTHyQkLzXM8HI4Sdk-2a50BoQ&oe=6A0C66D3"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "627211022861814", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031653_627211026195147_859210511188470322_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XLN-CFpb2ukQ7kNvwEKnRqC&_nc_oc=AdoRm-N_Zbbk8kUyA2obf1a-y6wrJKkJMfKKQxcx-iKl7vUkpo_8nELh0j1DivLUEcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af44PZ1xgG6_aIH0NpLKXD293SAiWKkTsO2tRPaKz2zXBg&oe=6A0C6128"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VRLegs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to \"VRLegs\", where the thrill of parkour meets the immersive world of virtual reality. Step into a realm where your movements are fluid, intuitive, and empowering. Our state-of-the-art locomotion system redefines how you move, jump, and traverse in the VR space, offering an unparalleled sensation of freedom.\n\nChallenge friends or team up in heart-pounding multiplayer tag matches. Navigate complex terrains, leap across buildings, and experience the exhilaration of real-time chases. As you master your environment, you'll discover new strategies, shortcuts, and moves to stay one step ahead or elude capture.\n\nWhether you're a parkour enthusiast or new to the world of VR, \"VRLegs\" promises an adrenaline-pumping experience like no other. Join the revolution, find your rhythm, and let the chase begin!", "short_description": "Unleash parkour prowess in \"VRLegs\"! Dive into multiplayer tag, powered by a groundbreaking VR locomotion system. Feel the rush!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrlegs.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ForkingVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrlegs.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppo